# Step 4: Test cases («Тест-кейсы»), BEFORE development
Derive every case from step-1 criteria and from step-2 API and error paths. Cover every criterion. Mark which cases become automated. Send a gap to step 3; do not close it in silence.

- Epic: no «Тест-кейсы» section. End-to-end scenarios stay in step 1 and are the epic acceptance checklist. An older epic page that already has «Тест-кейсы» stays as it is; do not treat that section as a screen TZ or as another task type.
- Feature (route stage 3): id (`ТК-1`), precondition, steps, expected, level (unit / integration / e2e / ручная на dev). Step 5 starts only after steps 1-4 are on this page («полное ТЗ», `playbook-workflow.mdc`).
- Bug or tiny fix: no «Тест-кейсы» section. Criteria on the issue, skip this section, then steps 5-7.
